{"4719700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SINKING INTO THE VOID", "steam_appid": 4719700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SINKING INTO THE VOID</strong> is a 2D side-scrolling hack-and-slash action game focused on intense battles against powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can equip up to three weapons at once and switch between them instantly to adapt to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat combines movement, jumping, and dashing with melee attacks, ranged attacks, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to guarding enemy attacks, players can perform a precise “Just Guard (Parry)” by blocking at the exact right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A successful parry can stun enemies, reflect projectiles, and completely turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features a wide variety of enemies, while boss stages offer even more challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes time attack elements, encouraging players to refine their routes, optimize their equipment, and push for faster clear times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is divided into six slots: Right Hand, Left Hand, Head, Body, Arms, and Legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items come in four rarity tiers: Normal, Rare, Epic, and Legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment can also grant a wide range of special effects, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching fireballs when attacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing damage as HP gets lower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becoming invincible while jumping</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining these effects, players can create their own unique combat style and build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choosing randomly dropped equipment, refining builds, and constantly improving clear records are at the core of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719700/extras/67d6156249472fde7d594d6e65da3eb8.poster.avif?t=1788320280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719700/extras/67d6156249472fde7d594d6e65da3eb8.webm?t=1788320280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719700/extras/67d6156249472fde7d594d6e65da3eb8.mp4?t=1788320280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SINKING INTO THE VOID</strong> is a 2D side-scrolling hack-and-slash action game focused on intense battles against powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can equip up to three weapons at once and switch between them instantly to adapt to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat combines movement, jumping, and dashing with melee attacks, ranged attacks, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to guarding enemy attacks, players can perform a precise “Just Guard (Parry)” by blocking at the exact right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A successful parry can stun enemies, reflect projectiles, and completely turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features a wide variety of enemies, while boss stages offer even more challenging encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes time attack elements, encouraging players to refine their routes, optimize their equipment, and push for faster clear times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is divided into six slots: Right Hand, Left Hand, Head, Body, Arms, and Legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items come in four rarity tiers: Normal, Rare, Epic, and Legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment can also grant a wide range of special effects, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching fireballs when attacking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing damage as HP gets lower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becoming invincible while jumping</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining these effects, players can create their own unique combat style and build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully choosing randomly dropped equipment, refining builds, and constantly improving clear records are at the core of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719700/extras/67d6156249472fde7d594d6e65da3eb8.poster.avif?t=1788320280\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719700/extras/67d6156249472fde7d594d6e65da3eb8.webm?t=1788320280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719700/extras/67d6156249472fde7d594d6e65da3eb8.mp4?t=1788320280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "SINKING INTO THE VOID is a 2D side-scrolling hack-and-slash action game focused on intense battles against powerful enemies.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719700/d1b1b3172954b91bb0bb6725ea36bd5269062767/header.jpg?t=1788320280", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719